{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-36c6b1b2610c","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-36c6b1b2610c","name":"意式烤鸡","category":"meat_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/meat_dish/%E6%84%8F%E5%BC%8F%E7%83%A4%E9%B8%A1.md","blob_sha":"131d89d8d5d107fb70b02ab0ad4ca7b4783024f5","details":{"introduction":"意式烤鸡是一道带有地中海风味的家常烤箱菜。鸡腿肉经过蒜香橄榄油腌制，烤后外皮微焦、内里鲜嫩多汁，搭配柠檬汁和欧芹，口感清爽不腻。鸡肉富含优质蛋白质，橄榄油提供不饱和脂肪酸，营养均衡。制作难度适中，需要提前预热烤箱，新手跟着步骤也能顺利完成，从腌制到出炉总计约五十分钟。","difficulty":"★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡腿肉\n- 盐\n- 黑胡椒\n- 橄榄油\n- 蒜\n- 柠檬汁\n- 欧芹"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 鸡腿肉用量通常来说为 1-2 个/人\n- 盐用量为 2 g/人\n- 黑胡椒用量为 0.5 g/人\n- 橄榄油用量为 5 ml/人\n- 蒜用量为 1 瓣/人\n- 柠檬汁用量为 5ml/人\n- 欧芹用量为 1 根/人\n\n使用上述条件，计算出计划使用的原材料比例。"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"### 鸡肉的预处理\n\n1. 鸡腿肉涂上盐、黑胡椒、橄榄油和蒜末\n2. 放入预热至 180 度的烤箱中，烤 30-40 分钟或至熟\n\n### 佐料的准备\n\n1. 欧芹切成碎末备用\n2. 柠檬挤出汁备用\n\n### 烤制\n\n1. 烤好的鸡肉取出，淋上柠檬汁\n2. 撒上欧芹碎即可"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 烤制时可以将鸡肉淋上蜂蜜或其他烤肉酱提升口感\n- 烤箱预热至 180 度，烤制时间根据鸡肉的大小和厚度而定，需确保鸡肉熟透\n- 鸡肉必须全熟才能吃，吃未全熟的鸡肉可能会导致食物中毒和感染细菌，如沙门氏菌和福氏杆菌等。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：鸡腿肉（去骨去皮）500g、去皮大蒜20g、柠檬汁20g、大豆食用油20g、黑胡椒粉3g、食盐4g；整份约450g。以去骨去皮鸡腿作标准份，不加香草及料酒的简化变体，烤汁全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":183.006667,"protein_g":22.256444,"carbohydrate_g":2.204444,"fat_g":9.076844},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173627/nutrients","version":"14b49158a3fabd42","fdc_ids":[173627,169230,167747,171411,170931,173468]},"profile_id":"family-36c6b1b2610c-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-36c6b1b2610c","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-36c6b1b2610c","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"bake","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-36c6b1b2610c-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"chicken_thigh","grams":500},{"key":"garlic","grams":20},{"key":"lemon_juice","grams":20},{"key":"oil","grams":20},{"key":"black_pepper","grams":3},{"key":"salt","grams":4}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"14b49158a3fabd42","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-36c6b1b2610c-v1.0a338acd7b8f08a5.json","bytes":27671,"sha256":"0a338acd7b8f08a5836ac14689822181afd148353b2d0822ce7b1c53246c27b8"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-36c6b1b2610c-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-36c6b1b2610c","recipe_blob_sha":"131d89d8d5d107fb70b02ab0ad4ca7b4783024f5","version":"1","data_version":"14b49158a3fabd42","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":450,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品450g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：鸡腿肉（去骨去皮）500g、去皮大蒜20g、柠檬汁20g、大豆食用油20g、黑胡椒粉3g、食盐4g；整份约450g。以去骨去皮鸡腿作标准份，不加香草及料酒的简化变体，烤汁全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-36c6b1b2610c","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"bake","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-36c6b1b2610c-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"chicken_thigh","grams":500},{"key":"garlic","grams":20},{"key":"lemon_juice","grams":20},{"key":"oil","grams":20},{"key":"black_pepper","grams":3},{"key":"salt","grams":4}],"